# Per-developer overrides for the harness Makefile (documented escape
# hatch for unrecognised stacks); machine-local by design.
Makefile.local

# Self-deploy surfaces outside a tool's own dot-directory. Codex writes
# skills under .agents/; Copilot deploys under .github/, which must itself
# stay tracked for workflows, so its deploy subpaths are ignored
# individually. AGENTS.md is NOT ignored: this repo tracks a hand-written
# bridge file there (rules source, like CLAUDE.md).
.agents/
.github/agents/
.github/knowledge-base/
.github/skills/
.github/templates/
.github/prompts/
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# Mutation testing sandbox
mutants/

# Generated eval artifacts
evals/captured/
.eval-out/
evals/eval-out-*.md

# Hypothesis example database (property-test cache)
.hypothesis/
